sible result.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\n[Shot 1] 00:00-00:02: camera: wide shot to medium shot, push in from the shore toward the pier, landing by 00:02 then locked. Sig starts from an upright stance at the left shore and hauls back hard on the bow rope with both hands, his body moving from vertical to a steep backward lean, the rope snapping taut; the boat\'s bow is dragged from the left frame edge toward the pier, fast, snappy, weighty, by 00:02 the action has landed at seventy percent of its endpoint. His brows are knotted, teeth clenched, jaw tight, eyes fixed on the boat.\\n00:02-00:04: camera: medium shot, locked off. The same pull completes: the hull drops onto the wet sand at the pier\'s end and stops, a deep groove torn through the sand, water and grit spraying to both sides, Sig\'s feet digging two shallow pits into the wet sand; no second pull is started. His expression stays strained, gaze still on the bow.\\n00:04-00:05: camera: medium shot, locked off. Sig holds at the landing position before the pier\'s end, shoulders rising and falling with breath, the rope still taut in his hands, his gaze shifting from the bow toward the pier\'s end; his face and hands remain clearly readable. All visible characters\' lips remain completely closed; no spoken dialogue and no inner voice in this shot.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nWet sand crunching and scraping under the hull, rope fibers creaking under tension, water lapping against the pier pilings, distant windmill blades turning in the dusk wind, Sig\'s heavy breathing settling in the final second.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nA low, sparse string pulse with a single soft drum hit landing at 00:02, then thinning to a quiet sustained tone through the closing second.\\n<<<EN>>>"},{"heading":"追上去（5-11秒） · 风车村·港口·黄昏 · 中景，横移跟随，跟路飞横穿栈桥，6 秒匀速","speaker":"路飞","dialogue":"路飞：「西格、待てよ！」","action":"路飞从岸上冲上栈桥木板，抬手指着西格的背，草帽在背后甩起来。","camera":"中景，横移跟随，跟路飞横穿栈桥，6 秒匀速","scene":"风车村·港口·黄昏","time_of_day":"","id":"beat-89f5163f103b","i