 direction. Do not turn the multi-view character sheet or the scene card into split panels; the shot stays a single 16:9 frame with one action only.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\n[Shot 1]\\n00:00-00:02: camera: full shot to wide shot, low angle, pull out, landing by 00:02 then locked. Continues from the previous shot\'s final state: Shanks stands at the near-side rail on the red deck under the same dusk light. He moves fast, snappy, weighty from a flat-footed stance at the deck edge onto the red rail and hurls his body forward over the outer side; by 00:02 the action has landed and he is already three-quarters past the rail, cape dragged up behind his shoulders. Eyes locked down at the sea, brows low, mouth tight.\\n00:02-00:04: camera: wide shot, low angle, locked off. The same leap carries his body into a leaning forward flight posture outside the hull; the black cape snaps open behind him into a full square of cloth, edges filled with wind, the red rail receding at the bottom edge while sunset burns through the cape\'s seams. Eyes still fixed on the water below, jaw clenched.\\n00:04-00:05: camera: wide shot, low angle, locked off. He drops toward the sea at lower frame right, the cape holding its opened trailing edge, the hem dragged into a last arc; his gaze stays on the landing point, expression a hard, resolved calm.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nFast crisp cloth snap as the cape unfurls, a heavy wooden creak from the rail taking his weight, wind rushing past, rigging ropes humming, distant low sea swell below the hull.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nA sharp orchestral hit on the push-off at 00:00, followed by one held low string swell that decays under the fall, no further percussion."},{"heading":"抱住（69-75秒） · 近海·风暴海面·黄昏 · 中景 → 近景，推近，水面高度，6 秒匀速","speaker":"香克斯","dialogue":"香克斯：「ルフィ、掴まれ！」","action":"香克斯在水里一把把路飞揽进怀里，转身用自己的背对着那张嘴。","camera":"中景 → 近景，推近，水面高度，6 秒匀速","scene":"近海·风暴海面·黄昏","time_of_day":"","id":"beat-091b555c9fc3","image_url":"","video_url":"https://img.zl