om the upper-left frame edge down onto Shanks\' left shoulder as the Lord of the Coast\'s upper and lower jaws close from the top edge to the middle of the frame; by 00:02 the bite has landed at seventy percent closed. Shanks\' profile is taut, eyes squeezed shut, jaw clenched, arms never loosening. No dialogue.\\n\\n00:02-00:03: camera: medium shot, locked off. The jaws snap fully shut; churning white foam surges from the bottom edge of the frame to the top edge and the black cloak is thrown up over the subject, and a single overexposed white flash bursts at the center of the frame. By 00:03 the foam has fully covered the subject. No dialogue.\\n\\n00:03-00:05: camera: medium shot, locked off. The foam and cloak fall back; Shanks\' red hair and shoulder line re-emerge behind the spray while the jaws hold at the upper left, seawater streaming between the teeth. The subject settles at the lower center of the frame, chest heaving, eyes still shut, arms still locked around what he shields. No dialogue.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nRoaring storm wind and crashing waves, a deep wet snap of massive jaws closing, a burst of water exploding upward, then falling spray and dripping seawater.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nLow ominous strings swell into a single hard percussive hit on the bite, then drop to a hollow sustained drone under the falling foam.\\n<<<EN>>>"},{"heading":"静（80-83秒） · 近海·风暴海面·黄昏 · 中景，固定，水面与斗篷下摆，3 秒","speaker":"","dialogue":"","action":"海面突然静下来，翻起的白浪缓缓回落，斗篷边缘一滴血落进水里，在水面荡开一圈红。","camera":"中景，固定，水面与斗篷下摆，3 秒","scene":"近海·风暴海面·黄昏","time_of_day":"","id":"beat-37abeb2d89c0","image_url":"","video_url":"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/video/20261113/024000_c0552dd41205fef3.mp4","duration":3,"prompt":"subject_definitions:\\n<Picture 1> Shanks character sheet provides identity and visual continuity for the red hair, facial scars, dark cloak, white shirt, and red sash, locking only face, hairstyle, and clothing without locking pose.\\n<Picture 2> The Lord of 