able.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nA sudden drop in wind and wave roar, leaving a hollow rushing sound of receding foam, followed by the tiny, dense plink of the blood droplet striking the water and a quiet, echoing spread of ripples.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nA brief, low, sustained string note that fades out into silence, emphasizing the heavy stillness of the sea after the storm.<<<EN>>>"},{"heading":"瞪视（83-88秒） · 近海·风暴海面·黄昏 · 大特写，固定，眼睛与断臂一侧的侧脸，5 秒","speaker":"香克斯","dialogue":"","action":"香克斯的眼睛占满画面，瞳孔没有收缩，雨水顺着眉骨流进眼眶，他一次都没有眨眼，视线穿过镜头盯着画面外的近海之王。","camera":"大特写，固定，眼睛与断臂一侧的侧脸，5 秒","scene":"近海·风暴海面·黄昏","time_of_day":"","id":"beat-770d8bbcf533","image_url":"","video_url":"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/video/20261113/024927_baf4a3f2e0eb6add.mp4","duration":5,"prompt":"subject_definitions:\\n- <Picture 1> Shanks character sheet: identity, red hair, the side of his face on the severed-arm side, costume and signature markers; locks only face, hairstyle and clothing, not pose.\\n- <Picture 2> Near-shore storm sea at dusk scene card: environment space, dusk light color, rain and sea surface; does not lock blocking.\\n\\nsummary:\\nA single locked extreme close-up of Shanks\'s eye and the side of his face on the severed-arm side, rain running down his brow into his eye, his pupil never contracting and his lids never blinking as he stares past the lens at the Sea King off-screen.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\nKeep <Picture 1> Shanks\'s red hair, brow line, eye shape, costume collar and the severed-arm side of his face consistent with the character sheet. Keep <Picture 2> the dusk storm-sea light direction and rain atmosphere as the background color field. The camera stays locked in extreme close-up; the only motion is the subject pressing in from the right edge to the center and the rain traveling down the brow into the eye. No storyboard panels, white background or repeated figures from the sheet enter frame.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\n[Shot 1] 00:00-00:02 camera: extreme close-up, locked off. Shanks\'s profile moves from the right edge of frame to the center of frame, fast, snappy and weighty, his eye going from half-open to fully fixed; by 00:02 the eye fills the center of frame. Rain runs down the brow to the lower eyelid. His brows are pressed down, his gaze pierces through the lens toward the off-screen Sea King. No dialogue.\\n00:02-00:03 camera: extreme close-up, locked off. The rain crosses the lower eyelid and enters the eye; the lid does not move, the pupil stays uncontracted, the stare stays nailed to the off-screen target. No dialogue.\\n00:03-00:05 camera: extreme close-up, locked off. Shanks holds the final position; only rain slides down his cheek, red hair is pressed by wind then falls back, his jaw tightens, and the eye never blinks. The frame still reads who he is and what he is staring at. No dialogue.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nHeavy rain hissing against skin and hair, low rolling thunder far out, wind buffeting the microphone, the faint slap of waves below, a single tight breath held without release.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nA low sustained string drone with a muted taiko pulse, no melody, tension held flat and unbroken through the final second.\\n<<<EN>>>"},{"heading":"咬牙（88-90秒） · 近海·风暴海面·黄昏 · 近景，固定，侧脸四分之三，2 秒","speaker":"","dialogue":"","action":"香克斯的侧脸占满画面，牙关咬到腮帮鼓起，太阳穴青筋绷起，汗混着雨从额角滑到下颌。","camera":"近景，固定，侧脸四分之三，2 秒","scene":"近海·风暴海面·黄昏","time_of_day":"","id":"beat-004e902a99d2","image_url":"","video_url":"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/video/20261113/025244_6b5d488bdcc8aa68.mp4","duration":2,"prompt":"subject_definitions:\\n<Picture 1> is the character sheet for Shanks, defining his face, red hair, three scars over the left eye, short chin beard, white shirt and black coat.\\n<Picture 2> is the scene card for the Near-Shore Storm Sea at dusk, defining the environment: dark storm sea, towering waves, distant pirate ship, orange dusk clouds.\\n\\nsummary:\\nA 2D cel-shaded anime close-up