fort; the straw hat bounces once on his head from the push and settles. Shanks stays kneeling at Luffy\'s left rear, lifts his gaze to Luffy\'s face and smiles. By 00:04 the fist has landed at the chest. Shanks (S2) says: <d>[Chinese] 楽しみにしてる。</d>\\n00:04-00:06: camera: medium close-up, locked off. Luffy holds the fist-at-chest pose with his chin slightly raised, chest rising and falling, eyes still fixed forward, mouth split in a grin; Shanks keeps his kneeling posture, gaze on Luffy\'s face, sea breeze moving both their clothes and the hat\'s chin cord. The frame ends readable: Luffy\'s face and raised fist clearly visible.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nSea breeze and small waves lapping against the pier and moored boats, distant gulls, the soft creak of wooden planks underfoot, the light snap of the straw hat brim flipping up, cloth rustling as the fist rises, and Shanks\' low warm chuckle under his line.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nA warm, restrained acoustic string and light brass swell that enters at 00:00, peaks softly as the fist lands at the chest around 00:03, and settles into a sustained hopeful chord through 00:06.\\n<<<EN>>>"},{"heading":"离港（130-135秒） · 风车村·码头栈桥·清晨 · 大全景，拉远，从栈桥向海，5 秒匀速","speaker":"香克斯","dialogue":"","action":"红色海贼船缓缓驶离栈桥，香克斯站在船尾举起右手，路飞在栈桥上追了几步停下。","camera":"大全景，拉远，从栈桥向海，5 秒匀速","scene":"风车村·码头栈桥·清晨","time_of_day":"","id":"beat-a770ef884a91","image_url":"","video_url":"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/video/20261113/131724_b457ab7990a10674.mp4","duration":5,"prompt":"subject_definitions:\\n- <Picture 1> Shanks character sheet: identity, red hair, clothing and signature look continuity; locks only face, hairstyle and outfit, not pose.\\n- <Picture 2> Luffy character sheet: identity, straw hat, clothing and silhouette continuity; locks only face, hairstyle and outfit, not pose.\\n- <Picture 3> Windmill Village dock pier at dawn scene card: environment, pier planks, sea surface, morning light and spatial layout; does not lock blocking.\\n\\nsummary:\\nA single wide shot at the Windmill Village pier at dawn. The red pirate ship pulls away from the pier while Shanks stands at the stern and raises his right hand; Luffy runs a few steps along the pier and stops at the edge. One continuous pull-out from the pier toward the sea, with the main action landing within the first two seconds.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\nThe red pirate ship and Shanks\'s raised right hand are the primary retention anchors, with Luffy\'s straw hat and forward run on the pier as the secondary anchor. <Picture 1> keeps Shanks\'s red hair and outfit readable at wide scale; <Picture 2> keeps Luffy\'s straw hat and silhouette distinct against the pier planks; <Picture 3> keeps the pier, mooring posts and morning sea direction consistent. The pull-out stays within one framing tier so both figures remain identifiable at the end.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\n[Shot 1] 00:00-00:02 camera: wide shot to wide shot, pull out, from the pier toward the sea, landing by 00:02 then locked. The red pirate ship moves fast, snappy and weighty from the near right side of the pier toward the left-back sea, its hull sliding away from the pier edge; by 00:02 the ship has cleared the pier by roughly one hull length. Shanks steps from behind the stern railing to the railing itself, his right hand rising from his side to above his shoulder, red hair and coat pushed by the sea wind. Luffy stays at the pier mid-section, straw hat on his head, eyes locked on the stern. No dialogue.\\n00:02-00:03 camera: wide shot, locked off. Shanks\'s right hand lands above his head, fingers spread, by 00:02 the gesture has landed; Luffy bursts from the pier mid-section to the pier end in two hard strides, soles striking the planks, then brakes at the edge. The ship keeps opening distance, white wake churning behind the stern. No dialogue.\\n00:03-00:05 camera: wide shot, locked off. Shanks stays at the stern railing with his right hand still raised, red hair and coat settling; Luffy stops at the pier end, torso pitching forward then steadying, his gaze under the straw hat brim tracking the stern. The final frame still reads who they are and what they are doing. No dialogue.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nMorning sea wind, gulls far off, the low churn of the ship\'s wake, wooden planks creaking under running footsteps, cloth flapping, then the pier settling into quiet.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nA warm, restrained farewell theme with soft strings and a single sustained brass note, rising slightly as the hand goes up, then easing into a quiet held chord.\\n<<<EN>>>"},{"heading":"十年后（135-141秒） · 近海·风暴海面·黄昏 · 大全景，固定，海面远机位，6 秒","speaker":"路飞","dialogue":"画外音：「あれから十年、海は何も変わらなかった。」","action":"一条小船从画面下方驶进海面，船上站着一个戴草帽的少年背影，船头切开浪。","camera":"大全景，固定，海面远机位，6 秒","scene":"近海·风暴海面·黄昏","time_of_day":"","id":"beat-9d901388bd4f","image_url":"","video_url":"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/video/20261113/134407_f5a5f818e8264057.mp4","duration":6,"prompt":"subject_definitions:\\n<Picture 1> is the character sheet for Luffy, providing identity and visual continuity: straw hat, red vest, blue shorts, chest scar; it locks only the face, hairstyle and clothing, never the pose, and its panel grid, white background and repeated figures must not enter the shot.\\n<Picture 2> is the scene card for the near-shore storm sea at dusk, providing the environment: low storm clouds, churning water, orange dusk light on the horizon; it does not lock character blocking.\\n\\nsummary:\\nA wide locked-off shot of a stormy near-shore sea at dusk. A small boat bursts in from the bottom edge of frame, its bow cutting a wave, a straw-hatted boy standing at the prow with his back to camera. The boat lands at center-lower frame within the first three seconds, then only rides the swell while an off-screen inner voice speaks.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\nLuffy\'s straw hat, red vest, blue shorts and chest scar must stay consistent with <Picture 1>; his back is to camera so the hat silhouette and vest color are the main anchors. The storm clouds, churning water and dusk light must stay consistent with <Picture 2>. The boat keeps the same shape and heading across the whole shot; no character teleporting, no costume loss, no panel grid or white background from the character sheet.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\n[Shot 1] 00:00-00:02: camera: wide shot, locked off. The small boat moves fast, snappy and weighty from outside the bottom edge of frame up to the lower-middle of frame, its bow knifing into the first wave and throwing white spray to both sides; by 00:02 the boat has crossed a quarter of the frame height. Luffy stands at the prow with his back to camera, straw hat pressed on, shoulders tight, gaze fixed on the horizon. No dialogue in this segment.\\n00:02-00:03: camera: wide shot, locked off. The boat lands at its final position at center-lower frame, the swell lifts the hull and slams it back down, the bow wave collapses outward in a full sheet of spray, and Luffy\'s back holds steady at the prow; by 00:03 the action has landed. An off-screen inner voice (not produced by the on-screen mouth) says in an off-screen voiceover: <d>[Chinese] あれから十年、海は何も変わらなかった。</d> while all visible characters\' lips remain completely closed.\\n00:03-00:06: camera: wide shot, locked off. The boat stays at center-lower frame riding the swell; Luffy\'s back only carries the aftermath — the straw hat is flicked up by wind and settles back, the red vest hem swings back down, he lifts his chin slightly toward the far horizon. The framing still clearly shows who he is and what he is doing. No dialogue in this segment.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nHeavy wind over open water, waves slapping and breaking against the hull, a low hull creak as the boat slams down, spray hissing, distant thunder rolling under the wind.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nA sparse, low sustained string drone with a single soft pulse, restrained and wide, sitting under the wind and fading out at the tail.\\n<<<EN>>>"}]},{"id":"ep-adf0288bb857","number":3,"title":"草帽里的封印","status":"script_ready","script_text":"第 3 集：草帽里的封印\\n【剧情概要】十年之后，艾尔巴夫雪原上的路飞觉醒失败。那十秒被放回去——咬断香克斯左臂的不是近海之王，是濒死觉醒的孩子。香克斯用草帽把形态按了回去，把那一缕黑发缝进了帽檐。\\n\\n### 镜头 1｜雪原（0-5秒）\\n- 人物：黑猿\\n- 场景：艾尔巴夫·雪原·闪前\\n- 道具：草帽\\n- 运镜：大全景 → 全景，推近，5 秒匀速\\n- 动作：暴雪里，一个直立的身影从雪雾深处一步步走出来，脚印在雪地上拉成一串。\\n- 音效：风雪、踩雪的闷响\\n- 提示词：ONE PIECE 原作动画设定稿风格，2D 赛璐璐平涂，中粗黑描线收边，硬边两层阴影，高饱和平涂色块，夸张透视，非写实、非3D、无胶片颗粒，艾尔巴夫暴雪雪原，一个直立身影从雪雾深处一步步走来，雪地脚印拉成一串，黑色巨树剪影，冷灰高对比\\n\\n### 镜头 2｜站定（5-10秒）\\n- 人物：黑猿\\n- 场景：艾尔巴夫·雪原·闪前\\n- 道具：草帽\\n- 运镜：全景 → 中景，推近，5 秒匀速\\n- 动作：黑猿在雪原中央停下，漆黑的长发和长尾被风掀向一侧，肩头云絮状的黑色毛发翻卷。\\n- 音效：风把毛发吹响、极低沉的喉音\\n- 提示词：ONE PIECE 原作动画设定稿风格，2D 赛璐璐平涂，中粗黑描线收边，硬边两层阴影，高饱和平涂色块，夸张透视，非写实、非3D、无胶片颗粒，雪原中央直立的人形黑兽停下，卷云状漆黑长发与长尾被风掀向一侧，肩头云絮状黑毛翻卷，背后草帽与蓝色破边短裤，冷灰雪原\\n\\n### 镜头 3｜金瞳（10-15秒）\\n- 人物：黑猿\\n- 场景：艾尔巴夫·雪原·闪前\\n- 道具：草帽\\n- 运镜：中近景 → 大特写，推近，5 秒匀速\\n- 动作：黑猿慢慢抬起头，琥珀金色的圆瞳在风雪里亮起来，瞳孔缩了一下。\\n- 音效：心跳、风声忽然降低\\n- 提示词：ONE PIECE 原作动画设定稿风格，2D 赛璐璐平涂，中粗黑描线收边，硬边两层阴影，高饱和平涂色块，夸张透视，非写实、非3D、无胶片颗粒，中近景黑兽慢慢抬头，琥珀金色圆瞳在风雪里亮起、瞳孔收缩，炭黑短绒毛与螺旋纹路，推近到大特写，冷灰\\n\\n### 镜头 4｜裂开的帽檐（15-20秒）\\n- 人物：黑猿\\n- 场景：艾尔巴夫·雪原·闪前\\n- 道具：草帽\\n- 运镜：近景 → 特写，推近，从手到帽檐裂缝，5 秒匀速\\n- 动作：黑猿抬起手碰了一下背后草帽的帽檐，帽檐边缘裂开一道细缝，一缕黑气从缝里冒出来。\\n- 音效：布料纤维崩断的细响、极轻的风\\n- 提示词：ONE PIECE 原作动画设定稿风格，2D 赛璐璐平涂，中粗黑描线收边，硬边两层阴影，高饱和平涂色块，夸张透视，非写实、非3D、无胶片颗粒，近景黑兽抬起手碰背后草帽的帽檐，帽檐边缘裂开一道细缝，一缕黑气从缝里冒出，推近特写，冷灰雪原\\n\\n### 镜头 5｜闪回·水面暗红（20-25秒）\\n- 人物：香克斯\\n- 场景：近海·风暴海面·黄昏\\n- 道具：红色披风\\n- 运镜：特写，固定，水面俯拍，5 秒\\n- 动作：水面上一团暗红从画面边缘慢慢扩开，颜色比上一集更浓，边缘清晰泛黑，黑丝在水里游动。\\n- 音效：水声、心跳、极低的嗡鸣\\n- 提示词：ONE PIECE 原作动画设定稿风格，2D 赛璐璐平涂，中粗黑描线收边，硬边两层阴影，高饱和平涂色块，夸张透视，非写实、非3D、无胶片颗粒，水面俯拍特写，暗红从画面边缘扩开、边缘泛黑，几缕黑丝在水里游动，定机位，不出现人体，冷青水面\\n\\n### 镜头 6｜闪回·心跳停止（25-30秒）\\n- 人物：路飞\\n- 场景：浅海·水下·冷青\\n- 道具：草帽\\n- 运镜：中景 → 近景，推近，5 秒匀速\\n- 动作：水下的路飞身体忽然抽了一下，四肢软下去，嘴里冒出的最后一串气泡往上飘走。\\n- 音效：心跳两声后完全静音、气泡上升\\n- 提示词：ONE PIECE 原作动画设定稿风格，2D 赛璐璐平涂，中粗黑描线收边，硬边两层阴影，高饱和平涂色块，夸张透视，非写实、非3D、无胶片颗粒，冷青水下，下沉的男孩身体忽然抽了一下四肢软下去，最后一串气泡往上飘走，推近，水压中的暗色礁石\\n\\n### 镜头 7｜闪回·破水（30-35秒）\\n- 人物：黑猿\\n- 场景：近海·风暴海面·黄昏\\n- 道具：草帽\\n- 运镜：全景 → 中景，仰拍，5 秒匀速\\n- 动作：水里炸开一大片白浪，一个通体漆黑的瘦长身影从水下立起来，草帽挂在背后。\\n- 音效：水爆、兽类的第一声低吼、水从身上淌下\\n- 提示词：ONE PIECE 原作动画设定稿风格，2D 赛璐璐平涂，中粗黑描线收边，硬边两层阴影，高饱和平涂色块，夸张透视，非写实、非3D、无胶片颗粒，风暴海面炸开大片白浪，一个通体漆黑瘦长的人形从水下立起，背后挂着草帽，仰拍，水从身上淌下，冷青高对比\\n\\n### 镜头 8｜闪回·咬（35-40秒）\\n- 人物：黑猿, 香克斯\\n- 场景：近海·风暴海面·黄昏\\n- 道具：红色披风\\n- 运镜：近景，固定，用斗篷和浪遮挡咬合点，5 秒\\n- 动作：黑猿扑到香克斯身上，头一低，獠牙咬进他左小臂内侧，香克斯的手在半空僵住。\\n- 音效：牙齿入肉的闷响、男人的吸气、水声\\n- 提示词：ONE PIECE 原作动画设定稿风格，2D 赛璐璐平涂，中粗黑描线收边，硬边两层阴影，高饱和平涂色块，夸张透视，非写实、非3D、无胶片颗粒，近景黑兽扑到红发男人身上低头咬向他左小臂内侧，翻起的斗篷与浪挡住咬合点不见血，男人的手僵在半空，定机位，冷青\\n\\n### 镜头 9｜闪回·螺旋纹亮（40-45秒）\\n- 人物：香克斯\\n- 场景：近海·风暴海面·黄昏\\n- 道具：浅海印记\\n- 运镜：特写 → 大特写，推近，5 秒匀速\\n- 动作：香克斯左小臂内侧的螺旋纹一圈圈亮起来，光沿着纹路往外走，到断口处断掉。\\n- 音效：像琴弦崩断的细响、低频嗡鸣\\n- 提示词：ONE PIECE 原作动画设定稿风格，2D 赛璐璐平涂，中粗黑描线收边，硬边两层阴影，高饱和平涂色块，夸张透视，非写实、非3D、无胶片颗粒，特写手臂内侧的螺旋果实纹路一圈圈亮起来，光沿纹路往外走，到断口处熄灭，推近大特写，冷青与暗红\\n\\n### 镜头 10｜闪回·按回去（45-50秒）\\n- 人物：香克斯, 黑猿\\n- 场景：近海·风暴海面·黄昏\\n- 道具：草帽\\n- 运镜：中景 → 全景，拉远，俯拍，5 秒匀速\\n- 动作：香克斯抬起右手按住黑猿的后脑，把它整个按回水里，水面炸开一圈白浪。\\n- 台词：香克斯：「戻れ、ルフィ。」\\n- 音效：水面合拢、压抑的兽吼、浪声\\n- 提示词：ONE PIECE 原作动画设定稿风格，2D 赛璐璐平涂，中粗黑描线收边，硬边两层阴影，高饱和平涂色块，夸张透视，非写实、非3D、无胶片颗粒，红发男人抬起右手按住黑兽的后脑把它整个按回水里，水面炸开一圈白浪，俯拍拉远，冷青海面\\n\\n### 镜头 11｜闪回·扣帽（50-55秒）\\n- 人物：香克斯, 路飞\\n- 场景：近海·风暴海面·黄昏\\n- 道具：草帽\\n- 运镜：中景 → 近景，推近，5 秒匀速\\n- 动作：黑毛从路飞身上一点点褪尽，变回七岁的孩子，香克斯把草帽扣在他头顶。\\n- 台词：香克斯：「お前だったのか。」\\n- 音效：水声渐远、风声回来、帽檐压下的轻响\\n- 提示词：ONE PIECE 原作动画设定稿风格，2D 赛璐璐平涂，中粗黑描线收边，硬边两层阴影，高饱和平涂色块，夸张透视，非写实、非3D、无胶片颗粒，黑毛从男孩身上一点点褪尽变回七岁的孩子，红发男人把草帽扣在他头顶，水面高度机位推近，冷青转暖橙\\n\\n### 镜头 12｜船尾·缝（55-60秒）\\n- 人物：香克斯\\n- 场景：红色海贼船·船尾·清晨\\n- 道具：草帽, 缆绳\\n- 运镜：中近景 → 特写，推近，从背影到手，5 秒匀速\\n- 动作：香克斯坐在船尾，把一缕黑发一样的细线缠进草帽内侧的帽檐，用针脚一针一针压住。\\n- 音效：针穿过草布的轻响、海浪、桅杆吱呀\\n- 提示词：ONE PIECE 原作动画设定稿风格，2D 赛璐璐平涂，中粗黑描线收边，硬边两层阴影，高饱和平涂色块，夸张透视，非写实、非3D、无胶片颗粒，清晨船尾，红发男人坐在栏杆边把一缕黑色细线缠进草帽内侧帽檐、一针一针缝住，左边袖管空荡，推近到手部特写，晨雾柔光\\n\\n### 镜头 13｜低吼（60-65秒）\\n- 人物：黑猿\\n- 场景：艾尔巴夫·雪原·闪前\\n- 道具：草帽\\n- 运镜：全景 → 大全景，拉远，5 秒匀速\\n- 动作：黑猿在雪原上仰起头，张开嘴发出一声长吼，喉咙深处的气浪把身前的雪掀起来。\\n- 台词：画外音：「この十秒を、誰も覚えていない。」\\n- 音效：长吼、风雪、极远处的回声\\n- 提示词：ONE PIECE 原作动画设定稿风格，2D 赛璐璐平涂，中粗黑描线收边，硬边两层阴影，高饱和平涂色块，夸张透视，非写实、非3D、无胶片颗粒，雪原上直立人形黑兽仰起头张嘴长吼，喉咙气浪把身前积雪掀起，拉远大全景，冷灰暴雪与黑色巨树剪影","summary":"十年之后，艾尔巴夫雪原上的路飞觉醒失败。那十秒被放回去——咬断香克斯左臂的不是近海之王，是濒死觉醒的孩子。香克斯用草帽把形态按了回去，把那一缕黑发缝进了帽檐。","episode_video_url":"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/video/20261113/170953_1bf860d409dd832f.mp4","beats":[{"heading":"雪原（0-5秒） · 艾尔巴夫·雪原·闪前 · 大全景，固定，风雪纵深，5 秒","speaker":"黑猿","dialogue":"","action":"暴雪里，一个直立的身影从雪雾深处一步步走出来，脚印在雪地上拉成一串。","camera":"大全景，固定，风雪纵深，5 秒","scene":"艾尔巴夫·雪原·闪前","time_of_day":"","id":"beat-71cd400b7a1b","image_url":"","video_url":"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/video/20261112/194344_4dc9378de6ac46b6.mp4","duration":5,"prompt":"subject_definitions:\\n<Picture 1> is the character sheet for Black Ape, providing identity and visual continuity of face, hairstyle and clothing only, not pose; do not bring the sheet\'s panels, white background or repeated figures into the shot. <Picture 2> is the scene card for Elbaf Snowfield Flash-Forward, providing the environment and spatial layout only, not blocking.\\n\\nsummary:\\nA single locked-off extreme wide shot in a 2D cel-shaded anime style: in a blizzard on the Elbaf snowfield, a lone upright figure walks out of the snow mist step by step, leaving a trail of footprints behind.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\nKeep <Picture 1> Black Ape\'s face, hairstyle and clothing consistent throughout; keep <Picture 2>\'s grey-white sky, black giant-tree silhouettes, falling snow and cracked straw-hat edge as the environment anchors. The figure stays upright and humanoid, snow accumulates on shoulders and hair, and the wind direction remains right to left.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\n[Shot 1] 00:00-00:02: camera: extreme wide shot, locked off. The subject moves from a blurred silhouette deep in the snow mist to the edge of the mist where the body begins to read clearly, lifting one leg and stepping forward. Snow falls densely, grey-white sky above, black giant-tree silhouettes behind. 00:02-00:04: camera: extreme wide shot, locked off. The subject moves from the mist edge to the left-center of frame, second step landing, the first chain of footprints stretching behind. 00:04-00:05: camera: extreme wide shot, locked off. The subject comes to rest at left-center of the snowfield, snow gathered on shoulders and hair ends, the trail of footprints running back into the mist; face and action remain readable. No dialogue in this shot; all visible characters\' lips remain completely closed.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nHowling blizzard wind with layered gusts, soft muffled crunch of boots pressing into deep snow, distant low rumble of the storm.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nLow sustained strings with a sparse cold drone, slowly rising in tension across the five seconds, no percussion.\\n<<<EN>>>"},{"heading":"金瞳（5-8秒） · 艾尔巴夫·雪原·闪前 · 中近景，固定，平视，3 秒","speaker":"黑猿","dialogue":"","action":"黑猿慢慢抬起头，琥珀金色的圆瞳在风雪里亮起来，瞳孔缩了一下。","camera":"中近景，固定，平视，3 秒","scene":"艾尔巴夫·雪原·闪前","time_of_day":"","id":"beat-740e8f41a323","image_url":"","video_url":"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/video/20261112/194349_2eb0d3606e07d4aa.mp4","duration":3,"prompt":"subject_definitions:\\n<Picture 1> is the character sheet for Black Ape, providing identity and appearance continuity: face, hairstyle and clothing only, not pose; do not bring the sheet\'s panels, white background or repeated figures into the shot. <Picture 2> is the scene card for Elbaf Snowfield Flash-Forward, providing environment and spatial layout only, not blocking.\\n\\nsummary:\\nA fixed medium close-up in a snowy Elbaf flash-forward: Black Ape slowly lifts its head from a bowed posture until it faces the camera, its amber-gold round pupils lighting up and contracting once as the wind-snow briefly softens.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\nRetain <Picture 1> for Black Ape\'s face shape, hairstyle and clothing; retain <Picture 2> for the grey-white sky, black giant tree silhouettes, drifting snow, the non-human footprint and the cracked straw-hat edge on the snow. Keep the wind direction and light direction consistent across the shot. No form change occurs in this shot.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\n[Shot 1] 00:00-00:02: camera: medium close-up, eye level, locked off. The subject moves from a bowed head with chin near the chest up to a near-eye-level head height, neck slowly straightening; eyes cast downward, brows low, mouth closed. Drifting snow crosses the lower frame, black giant tree silhouettes behind.\\n00:02-00:04: camera: medium close-up, eye level, locked off. The subject continues the same lift from near-eye-level to fully facing the camera; the amber-gold round pupils emerge from half-shadow and begin to glow, snow streaking past its cheek. Lips remain completely closed.\\n00:04-00:05: camera: medium close-up, eye level, locked off. The subject settles facing the camera, pupils contracting sharply once, lashes and forehead fur lifted by the wind, gaze locked forward, brows pressed down, mouth tight and unsmiling. The face and glowing gold eyes remain clearly readable in the final frame.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nWind and snow dominate, then abruptly soften around 00:02 as the head rises; a low, thin airy hush remains, with faint snow-crust creaks underfoot.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nA single sustained low string tone swelling slightly at 00:04, no percussion, cold and sparse.\\n<<<EN>>>"},{"heading":"裂开的帽檐（8-12秒） · 艾尔巴夫·雪原·闪前 · 近景，固定，侧后方带帽檐，4 秒","speaker":"黑猿","dialogue":"","action":"黑猿抬起手碰了一下背后草帽的帽檐，帽檐边缘裂开一道细缝，一缕黑气从缝里冒出来。","camera":"近景，固定，侧后方带帽檐，4 秒","scene":"艾尔巴夫·雪原·闪前","time_of_day":"","id":"beat-19008fc7739f","image_url":"","video_url":"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/video/20261112/194353_ac5ae6d41a2e7405.mp4","duration":4,"prompt":"subject_definitions:\\n<Picture 1> is the character sheet for Black Ape, providing identity and visual continuity for the face, hairstyle, and clothing only; it does not lock the pose, and the sheet\'s panel grid, white background, and repeated figures must not appear in the shot.\\n<Picture 2> is the scene card for Elbaf Snowfield Flash-Forward, providing the environment space only; it does not lock character blocking.\\n\\nsummary:\\nA single fixed close shot from behind and to the side of Black Ape in a snowy Elbaf flash-forward: he raises one hand to the brim of the straw hat on his back, and a thin crack opens along the brim edge, releasing a wisp of black mist.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\n<Picture 1> keeps Black Ape\'s face, hairstyle, and clothing consistent across the whole shot, with the straw hat on his back as the key identifying prop. <Picture 2> keeps the gray-white sky, black giant tree silhouettes, falling snow, and the non-human footprint in the snow consistent as background space. The camera stays locked off in a close shot from behind and to the side, so the brim stays readable from the first frame to the last.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\n[Shot 1] 00:00-00:02 camera: close shot, locked off, framing Black Ape from behind and to the side with the straw hat brim in the foreground. The subject moves from his right hand hanging at his side up to the brim edge of the straw hat on his back, fingertips just touching the brim. His side profile shows brows slightly lowered, gaze angled back toward the brim, mouth flat. Gray-white sky, black giant tree silhouettes, and falling snow fill the background. No dialogue.\\n00:02-00:04 the same action continues: the subject moves from fingertips touching the brim edge to pressing along the brim until a thin crack opens at the edge, and a wisp of black mist seeps out of the crack. Camera remains locked off in the same close shot with no additional movement. His gaze stays fixed on the brim, jaw tight. No dialogue.\\n00:04-00:05 the action settles: the subject stops with his hand resting at the brim edge, fingertips tightening slightly as the black mist spreads at the crack mouth. The final frame still clearly shows Black Ape\'s side face and the cracked brim. No dialogue.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nA soft, dry fabric-tearing hiss as the brim edge splits, layered under the low hush of wind over snow and the faint crunch of distant snowfall. No voices.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nA single low sustained string tone with a thin high shimmer, held quietly under the fabric crack and fading at the end of the shot.\\n<<<EN>>>"},{"heading":"闪回·水面暗红（13-17秒） · 近海·风暴海面·黄昏 · 特写，固定，水面俯拍，4 秒","speaker":"香克斯","dialogue":"","action":"水面上一团暗红从画面边缘慢慢扩开，颜色比上一集更浓，边缘清晰泛黑，黑丝在水里游动。","camera":"特写，固定，水面俯拍，4 秒","scene":"近海·风暴海面·黄昏","time_of_day":"","id":"beat-68ab59ec87b1","image_url":"","video_url":"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/video/20261112/200221_583f941f40234349.mp4","duration":4,"prompt":"subject_definitions:\\n- <Picture 1> Shanks character sheet, providing identity and appearance continuity (locks only face, hairstyle, and clothing, not pose; do not bring the sheet\'s panels, white background, or repeated figures into the shot)\\n- <Picture 2> Nearshore stormy sea at dusk scene card, providing environment space (does not lock blocking)\\n\\nsummary:\\nA fixed overhead close-up of the stormy nearshore sea at dusk, where a patch of dark red slowly spreads from the frame edge, denser than before, with clear blackening edges and black threads drifting in the water.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\nRetain the dark-red water patch as the sole subject and its continuous spreading motion from the lower-left edge toward the center-right. Retain the stormy sea texture, lead-gray clouds, and dusk light from <Picture 2>. <Picture 1> is not visible in this shot; no character appears, so no face, hairstyle, or clothing continuity is carried.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\n[Shot 1] 00:00-00:02: camera: close-up, locked off, overhead view of the water surface. The dark-red patch moves from the lower-left edge of the frame to the lower-center, spreading outward as its edges begin to darken. The surrounding water churns with white foam under lead-gray clouds and dusk light. No dialogue.\\n00:02-00:04: camera: close-up, locked off, overhead view. The same dark-red patch moves from the lower-center to the center of the frame, expanding further with sharper blackened edges, while thin black threads drift and curl within the red. No dialogue.\\n00:04-00:05: camera: close-up, locked off, overhead view. The dark-red patch settles at the center-right of the frame, its spreading motion easing, with black threads still drifting near the edges. The stormy sea and dusk sky remain visible around it. No dialogue.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nMuffled underwater sounds, low and dense, with a faint churn of water and no voices. No character lips are visible.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nA low sustained drone under the muffled water, no melody, fading at the tail.\\n<<<EN>>>"},{"heading":"闪回·心跳停止（17-21秒） · 浅海·水下·冷青 · 中景，固定，水下平视，4 秒","speaker":"路飞","dialogue":"","action":"水下的路飞身体忽然抽了一下，四肢软下去，嘴里冒出的最后一串气泡往上飘走。","camera":"中景，固定，水下平视，4 秒","scene":"浅海·水下·冷青","time_of_day":"","id":"beat-acd5dabddd33","image_url":"","video_url":"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/video/20261112/200224_93e3e2912fa0356f.mp4","duration":4,"prompt":"subject_definitions:\\n- <Picture 1>: Monkey D. Luffy character sheet, providing identity, hairstyle, and outfit (red vest, blue shorts, straw hat). Lock face, hair, and clothing only; do not lock pose or include grid/white background.\\n- <Picture 2>: Shallow sea underwater scene card, providing environment space (cold cyan light, suspended bubbles, sinking light rays, dark rocks). Does not lock character placement.\\n\\nsummary:\\nA single continuous shot of Luffy underwater in a flashback. He suddenly convulses, his limbs go limp, and the last string of bubbles escapes his mouth and floats upward. The camera is locked off in a medium shot at eye level. No dialogue, no narration.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\n- <Picture 1>: Luffy\'s face, hair, red vest, and straw hat must remain consistent; no grid or white background from the sheet.\\n- <Picture 2>: Underwater environment with cold cyan tones, bubbles, and light rays must be preserved; character placement is not locked to the scene card.\\n- Motion: continuous single action from convulsion to limpness; no extra movements or cuts.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\n[Shot 1] \\n00:00-00:02: camera: medium shot, locked off. Luffy floats in the water, then his body suddenly jerks in a convulsion, limbs beginning to lose strength. The subject moves from a floating suspension to a sudden twitch, arms and legs starting to slacken. Eyes unfocused, mouth slightly open.\\n00:02-00:04: camera: medium shot, locked off. The same action continues: Luffy\'s limbs go completely limp, and the last string of bubbles escapes his mouth and floats upward. The subject moves from the convulsion to full limpness, limbs drifting downward. Eyes empty, face slack.\\n00:04-00:05: camera: medium shot, locked off. The action settles: Luffy remains suspended in a limp, unconscious posture, hair and vest edges drifting slightly in the current. The subject stays in the limp floating position. Face visible, eyes closed or blank, expression lifeless.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nMuffled underwater ambience, a dull thud, and the sound of a heartbeat stopping. Bubbles rising with soft gurgles. No dialogue.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nLow, ominous drone fading into silence as the heartbeat stops.\\n<<<END>>>"},{"heading":"静·气泡散尽（22-24秒） · 浅海·水下·冷青 · 中景，固定，与上一镜同机位，2 秒","speaker":"路飞","dialogue":"","action":"最后一串气泡没了，水里彻底安静，路飞的头发缓缓沉下去。","camera":"中景，固定，与上一镜同机位，2 秒","scene":"浅海·水下·冷青","time_of_day":"","id":"beat-d77be5f69a62","image_url":"","video_url":"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/video/20261112/200226_82d3d2d6159ed91c.mp4","duration":2,"prompt":"subject_definitions:\\n- <Picture 1> Luffy character sheet: provides identity and appearance continuity — face, hairstyle, straw hat and red top; pose is not locked.\\n- <Picture 2> Shallow sea underwater, cold cyan scene card: provides the environment — suspended bubbles, sinking light shafts, distorted surface refraction, dark rocks, rubber texture deforming under water pressure; staging is not locked.\\n\\nsummary:\\nA single locked-off medium shot underwater in cold cyan light. The last string of bubbles rises out of frame and vanishes, the water goes completely still, and Luffy\'s hair slowly sinks down as his body hangs motionless.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\n- <Picture 1> keeps Luffy\'s face, hairstyle, straw hat and red top consistent with the previous shot.\\n- <Picture 2> keeps the cold cyan water, sinking light shafts, suspended particles and dark rocks consistent.\\n- The straw hat and red top remain the recognizable anchor throughout the shot.\\n- The only motion is the sinking of the hair and the fading of the last bubbles; no pose or costume change.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\n[Shot 1] 00:00-00:02: camera: medium shot, locked off, same setup as the previous shot. The subject stays suspended at the lower center of frame while the last string of bubbles rises from in front of his mouth and nose to the top edge of frame, shrinking and scattering. His eyes are half closed, gaze unfocused upward, brows relaxed, mouth corners slack. No dialogue.\\n00:02-00:04: camera: medium shot, locked off. The subject continues the same motion: with the bubbles gone the water goes still, and his hair moves from floating upward to slowly sinking, strands dropping from the upper frame toward his forehead and shoulders, a larger displacement than the previous beat. Expression unchanged, eyes half closed, gaze drifting. No dialogue.\\n00:04-00:05: camera: medium shot, locked off. The subject settles at the lower center of frame in a hanging posture, hair and hem still swaying faintly, face and straw hat fully readable. Eyes half closed, brows relaxed, mouth corners turned down. No dialogue.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nComplete silence. No bubbles, no water movement, no ambience — the underwater space is entirely muted for the whole shot.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nNone. No score, no drone, no tonal bed; the absence of sound is the point of the shot.\\n<<<EN>>>"},{"heading":"闪回·破水（24-27秒） · 近海·风暴海面·黄昏 · 全景 → 中景，推近，低机位仰拍，3 秒","speaker":"黑猿","dialogue":"","action":"水里炸开一大片白浪，一个通体漆黑的瘦长身影从水下立起来，草帽挂在背后。","camera":"全景 → 中景，推近，低机位仰拍，3 秒","scene":"近海·风暴海面·黄昏","time_of_day":"","id":"beat-37c0d8cc2e29","image_url":"","video_url":"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/video/20261112/204340_bb2ef32d8721a14b.mp4","duration":3,"prompt":"subject_definitions:\\n<Picture 1> is the character sheet for Black Ape, a tall, thin figure rendered entirely in jet black, with a straw hat hanging on his back; it locks only his face, hairstyle and clothing, never his pose. <Picture 2> is the scene card for the Nearshore Storm Sea at Dusk, providing lead-grey cloud layers, churning white surf, a tilted small wooden boat, floating barrels, the distant silhouette of a windmill village hill, and salty sea mist; it provides environment and spatial layout only, not blocking.\\n\\nsummary:\\nA single continuous shot: a jet-black, tall, thin figure bursts up out of the storm sea at dusk, a huge sheet of white spray exploding around him, his straw hat swinging on his back, while the camera makes one low-angle push-in from a full shot to a medium shot over three seconds.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\n<Picture 1> must retain Black Ape\'s jet-black body, tall thin silhouette, and the straw hat hanging on his back across every frame. <Picture 2> must retain the lead-grey storm clouds, churning white surf, tilted wooden boat, floating barrels, distant windmill village hill silhouette, and salty mist. The single continuous push-in must not reverse or fold back, and the final framing must still clearly show who the figure is and what he is doing.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\n[Shot 1] 00:00-00:02: camera: full shot to medium shot, push in, low-angle looking up, over 3s. The subject moves from beneath the water\'s surface, head and shoulders not yet visible, to the crest of the exploding white spray as the sea surface bursts open around him. Lead-grey storm clouds and the distant windmill village hill silhouette sit behind the surf. No dialogue.\\n00:02-00:04: the same push-in continues without changing direction. The subject moves from shoulders breaking the surface to his full upper body standing clear of the water, his tall thin torso rising through the spray while the straw hat on his back swings backward with the mist. His eyes open toward the upper front, brows lowered, mouth tight, not smiling. No dialogue.\\n00:04-00:05: the push-in settles and stops. The subject comes to rest at half-body height above the scattering surf, water dripping from the brim of the straw hat and from his arms, white foam breaking into bubbles at his waist. The framing still clearly shows who he is and what he is doing. No dialogue.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nA massive water-breaking crash as the sea surface explodes, layered with heavy spray and falling droplets, the low roar of the storm sea, wind over the waves, and the creak of the tilted wooden boat.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nA single low, swelling orchestral hit timed to the water burst, then a sustained dark string drone that fades under the falling droplets."},{"heading":"闪回·咬（27-30秒） · 近海·风暴海面·黄昏 · 近景，固定，用斗篷和浪遮挡咬合点，3 秒","speaker":"香克斯","dialogue":"","action":"黑猿扑到香克斯身上，头一低，獠牙咬进他左小臂内侧，香克斯的手在半空僵住。","camera":"近景，固定，用斗篷和浪遮挡咬合点，3 秒","scene":"近海·风暴海面·黄昏","time_of_day":"","id":"beat-a18ce50c99ad","image_url":"","video_url":"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/video/20261112/204342_20a2bc4703442059.mp4","duration":3,"prompt":"subject_definitions:\\n- <Picture 1> Black Ape character sheet: identity and silhouette continuity, locking only face, hairstyle and clothing, not pose; do not bring sheet panels, white background or repeated figures into the shot.\\n- <Picture 2> Shanks character sheet: identity and silhouette continuity, locking only face, hairstyle and clothing, not pose; do not bring sheet panels, white background or repeated figures into the shot.\\n- <Picture 3> Near-shore storm sea at dusk scene card: environment and spatial layout only, does not lock blocking.\\n\\nsummary:\\nA 2D cel-shaded anime flashback close shot on a storm-tossed small boat at dusk: the Black Ape lunges onto Shanks and drives its fangs into the inner side of his left forearm, while a cloak and a cresting wave hide the bite point and Shanks\'s right hand freezes in mid-air.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\nRetain <Picture 1> for the Black Ape\'s face, mane and body silhouette; retain <Picture 2> for Shanks\'s face, hair and clothing; retain <Picture 3> for the lead-grey clouds, tilted wooden boat, floating barrels, distant windmill-village hill silhouette and salty sea mist. Keep the dusk side-back light direction and the cloak-and-wave occlusion of the bite point across the whole shot.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\n[Shot 1] 00:00-00:02 camera: close shot, locked off. The Black Ape moves from the upper edge of the boat deck on the right side of frame to a forward lunge above Shanks\'s chest, shoulders hunched, eyes narrowed, fangs bared, gaze fixed on the left forearm; Shanks braces against the deck, brows drawn, jaw tight.\\n00:02-00:04 camera: close shot, locked off. The same lunge continues as the Black Ape\'s head moves from Shanks\'s shoulder down to the inner side of his left forearm, fangs pressing in while the cloak hem and a cresting white wave sweep up together to hide the bite point; sea spray scatters across the foreground.\\n00:04-00:05 camera: close shot, locked off. Shanks\'s right hand moves from the boat edge up to freeze in mid-air, fingers spread and motionless, his face turned toward the bite, brows knotted, teeth clenched; the frame settles with both upper bodies and the frozen hand clearly readable.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nSuppressed beast growl close to the ear, heavy crashing waves, wood creaking on the tilted boat, wet cloak flapping, sea mist hiss, no dialogue.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nLow sustained string drone with a single muffled drum hit at the moment of the bite, fading under the wave wash.\\n<<<EN>>>"},{"heading":"静·白浪悬停（30-32秒） · 近海·风暴海面·黄昏 · 近景，固定，与上一镜同机位，2 秒","speaker":"香克斯","dialogue":"","action":"白浪停在半空不落，两个人影都不动，只剩斗篷一角在风里翻。","camera":"近景，固定，与上一镜同机位，2 秒","scene":"近海·风暴海面·黄昏","time_of_day":"","id":"beat-bd91e5c3d262","image_url":"","video_url":"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/video/20261112/204344_3d43863f528c4e38.mp4","duration":2,"prompt":"subject_definitions:\\n<Picture 1> is the character sheet for Kurozaru, providing identity, hairstyle, outfit, and signature markers; it locks only the face, hair, and clothing, never the pose.\\n<Picture 2> is the character sheet for Shanks, providing identity, hairstyle, outfit, and signature markers; it locks only the face, hair, and clothing, never the pose.\\n<Picture 3> is the scene card for the near-shore storm sea at dusk, providing the environment: lead-grey cloud layers, curling white waves, a tilted small wooden boat, floating barrels, the silhouette of a windmill village hill in the distance, and salty sea mist; it does not lock blocking.\\n\\nsummary:\\nA single locked-off close shot on the storm sea at dusk: a white wave hangs frozen in mid-air and never falls, two figures stand utterly still on the tilted boat, and only one corner of a cloak flips in the wind. The shot is completely silent.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\nRetain the 2D cel-shaded anime look with mid-thick black outlines, hard two-layer shadows, and flat saturated color blocks. Retain Kurozaru and Shanks from <Picture 1> and <Picture 2> with identical faces, hairstyles, and outfits across the shot. Retain the environment from <Picture 3>: lead-grey clouds, curling white waves, tilted wooden boat, floating barrels, distant windmill hill silhouette, salty mist. Retain the frozen white wave that never falls and the single flipping cloak corner. Avoid any drift of identity, costume, or marker; avoid photoreal texture, 3D CGI, panel layouts, white backgrounds, or repeated figures from the character sheets.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\n[Shot 1] 00:00-00:02 camera: close shot, locked off, same setup as the previous shot. The subject moves from the two figures leaning against either side of the tilted boat hull to the same leaning stillness, while the white wave curls up in front of the bow and freezes at its crest with droplets suspended in the air. Both figures\' brows are pressed down, their gazes fixed forward on the hanging wave, mouths flat and unsmiling. No dialogue.\\n00:02-00:04 camera: close shot, locked off, no additional movement. The subject moves from the previous stillness to a deeper immobility, the frozen wave holding from crest to belly without falling, the only motion being one corner of a cloak lifted by wind from behind the shoulder to the side of the body. Eyes stay locked on the wave, jaws tight. No dialogue.\\n00:04-00:05 camera: close shot, locked off. The subject settles: the cloak corner flips from the side back behind the shoulder, the two figures come to rest on the tilted boat, hair and hem pressed by the wind. The framing still clearly shows Kurozaru\'s and Shanks\'s profiles and bodies. No dialogue.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nComplete silence for the entire shot: no wind roar, no wave crash, no wood creak, no footsteps, no breathing. The absence of sound is the point.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nNone. No score, no drone, no stinger; the shot stays in total silence.\\n<<<EN>>>"},{"heading":"闪回·螺旋纹亮（32-35秒） · 近海·风暴海面·黄昏 · 特写，固定，左小臂内侧，3 秒","speaker":"香克斯","dialogue":"","action":"香克斯左小臂内侧的螺旋纹一圈圈亮起来，光沿着纹路往外走，到断口处断掉。","camera":"特写，固定，左小臂内侧，3 秒","scene":"近海·风暴海面·黄昏","time_of_day":"","id":"beat-70b6fae7a8ca","image_url":"","video_url":"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/video/20261112/204345_b3a9972f1b3b031c.mp4","duration":3,"prompt":"subject_definitions:\\n<Picture 1> is the Sha