inner ring outward along the spiral groove, brightness building ring by ring, and stops short at the break in the pattern. The forearm holds its position in center-left frame, skin catching a hard-edged highlight.\\n00:04-00:05: camera: close-up, locked off. The glow stalls at the break and spills outward for an instant, then dies, leaving only a thin residual rim of light along the broken edge. The forearm rests in center-left frame, the marking and old scar still clearly readable. No lips and no spoken lines.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nA low, deep resonance hums under the shot, thick and slow like pressure against the eardrum. Distant storm surf rolls and hisses behind it, with the creak of a wooden hull and gusting sea wind. The resonance swells as the light travels the groove, then cuts to near silence at the break, leaving only muffled waves.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nA sustained low string drone with a faint metallic overtone, rising in a single slow swell that peaks at the break and drops away, no melody, no percussion, fading to a thin sustained tail.<<<ZH>>>\\n镜头12，总时长5秒，内部时间从00:00开始，16:9 横屏。\\n\\n镜头目的：\\n闪回中香克斯左小臂内侧的螺旋纹一圈圈亮起，光沿纹路往外走，到断口处断掉，交代这道旧纹路与风暴海面的呼应。\\n\\n参考素材：\\n- <Picture 1>【角色设定板 / 香克斯】提供身份、红色短发、左眼三道疤、敞口白衬衫、深色披风、红色腰封、左小臂旧痕\\n- <Picture 2>【场景主视角 / 近海·风暴海面·黄昏】提供铅灰云层、橙红落日、翻卷白浪、腥咸海雾与远处山丘剪影的空间关系\\n\\n必须出现的视觉内容：\\n- 香克斯左小臂内侧的螺旋纹，原作辨识锚点落在螺旋走向与断口\\n- 光沿着纹路向外走、到断口处断开\\n- 背景压成风暴黄昏的橙红与铅灰冷调，皮肤上带硬边高光\\n\\n按旁白和画面内容切镜（每段都要写出主体从哪到哪，禁止只写状态；机位默认固定）：\\n- 00:00–00:02：香克斯的左小臂从画面下缘抬入，停在画面中央偏左，小臂内侧的螺旋纹最内圈先亮起，光点从纹心起步，机位固定特写。本段无台词。\\n- 00:02–00:04：同一圈光沿螺旋纹从内圈向中段推进，亮度一层层加高，到纹路断口处光势一顿，机位保持固定特写，不再追加运镜。本段无台词。\\n- 00:04–00:05：光在断口处停住并向外溢出一瞬，随即断掉，只留断口边缘一圈余辉，小臂停在画面中央偏左，肌肤与旧痕清晰可辨。本段无台词。\\n\\n对白：\\n- 本镜无开口台词，所有可见角色嘴唇闭合。\\n\\n旁白：\\n- 本镜无第三人称旁白。角色内心写在对白里，标（内心）。\\n\\n画面要求：\\n- 2D cel-shaded anime，中粗黑描线收边，硬边两层阴影，高饱和平涂色块，干净线稿\\n- 机位规格（必须一行写完）：【固定 特写】，左小臂内侧，不做推拉\\n- 主体动作弧线：香克斯的左小臂在本镜内从画面下缘抬入到画面中央偏左停稳，全程只做这一个动作；表情与视线不入画，画面只给手臂与纹路\\n- 前景为小臂与纹路，中景为翻涌白浪与小木船边缘，背景为橙红落日与铅灰云层；主体在画面九宫格的左下格→中左格\\n- 跨镜连续性：继承上一镜的敞口白衬衫袖口、深色披风与红色腰封，风暴黄昏的光从画面左上方打来\\n- 本镜保持香克斯左"},{"heading":"闪回·按回去（35-42秒） · 近海·风暴海面·黄昏 · 中景，固定，俯拍，6 秒","speaker":"香克斯","dialogue":"香克斯：「戻れ、ルフィ。」","action":"香克斯抬起右手按住黑猿的后脑，把它整个按回水里，水面炸开一圈白浪。","camera":"中景，固定，俯拍，6 秒","scene":"近海·风暴海面·黄昏","time_of_day":"","id":"beat-fa749e4611a3","image_url":"","video_url":"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/video/20261112/204347_4d114c474d0bea0c.mp4","duration":6,"prompt":"subject_definitions:\\n<Picture 1> is the character sheet for Shanks, locking his face, hairstyle, straw hat and cloak for continuity; the sheet\'s panels, white background and repeated figures must not enter the shot.\\n<Picture 2> is the character sheet for the Black Ape, locking its face and beast-form silhouette; the sheet\'s panels, white background and repeated figures must not enter the shot.\\n<Picture 3> is the scene card for the stormy coastal sea at dusk, providing lead-grey clouds, churning whitecaps, a tilted wooden boat, floating barrels, the distant silhouette of Windmill Village\'s hill and salty sea mist; it does not lock blocking.\\n\\nsummary:\\nA single fixed high-angle medium shot at dusk over a stormy sea: Shanks raises his right hand and presses the Black Ape\'s head back down into the water, bursting a ring of white foam.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\nRetain Shanks\' face, hairstyle, straw hat and cloak from <Picture 1>; retain the Black Ape\'s face and beast-form silhouette from <Picture 2>; retain the lead-grey clouds, whitecaps, tilted boat, floating barrels and distant hill silhouette from <Picture 3>. The shot stays a single 16:9 frame with no panels, no white background and no repeated figures.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\n[Shot 1] 00:00-00:02 camera: medium shot, high angle, locked off. Shanks moves from a half-kneeling position at the boat\'s edge, his right arm rising from his side to above the Black Ape\'s head, palm open and pressing down; his brows are lowered, his eyes fixed on the back of the ape\'s head, his mouth tight. Shanks (S1) says: <d>[Chinese] 戻れ、ルフィ。</d>\\n00:02-00:04 camera: medium shot, high angle, locked off. The same downward press continues as Shanks\' palm moves from above the ape\'s head to the water surface, driving the Black Ape\'s head fully under; white foam bursts outward in a ring. No dialogue in this segment.\\n00:04-00:06 camera: medium shot, high angle, locked off. The motion settles with Shanks\' palm stopped at the waterline, the surface closing into a ring of white spray, his cloak hem and hair lifted by the wind; his face and pressing hand remain clearly readable. No dialogue in this segment.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nWind-driven waves slapping the tilted wooden boat, water closing over the ape\'s head with a heavy splash, a muffled beast roar pressed underwater, and the low rush of storm wind.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nA low, tense string drone with a single deep drum hit on the splash, fading under the wind.\\n<<<EN>>>"},{"heading":"反应·空袖管（42-44秒） · 近海·风暴海面·黄昏 · 近景，固定，平视香克斯正脸，2 秒","speaker":"香克斯","dialogue":"","action":"香克斯低头看自己左边空掉的袖管，眼睛没眨，嘴唇抿成一条线。","camera":"近景，固定，平视香克斯正脸，2 秒","scene":"近海·风暴海面·黄昏","time_of_day":"","id":"beat-de08fcf5be1c","image_url":"","video_url":"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/video/20261112/204350_98dc3ca58cbc73ed.mp4","duration":2,"prompt":"subject_definitions:\\n<Picture 1> is the character sheet for Shanks, locking only his face, red hair, the three scars across his left eye, beige shirt and dark cloak; it does not lock his pose.\\n<Picture 2> is the scene card for the near-shore storm sea at dusk, providing lead-grey cloud layers, curling whitecaps, a tilted small wooden boat, floating barrels, the distant silhouette of Foosha Village hill and salty sea mist; it does not lock blocking.\\n\\nsummary:\\nA single fixed close-up of Shanks lowering his head to look at his empty left sleeve on a storm-tossed dusk sea, lips pressed into a thin line, eyes unblinking, with only wind on the soundtrack.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\n<Picture 1> keeps Shanks\' red hair, left-eye scars, beige shirt and dark cloak consistent across the whole shot. <Picture 2> keeps the lead-grey storm clouds, whitecaps, tilted boat and distant hill silhouette as the background space. The recognizable anchor is the red hair plus the three scars, paired with the conspicuously empty left sleeve. The shot holds one continuous downward head motion and one emotional read: quiet grief held in check.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\n[Shot 1] 00:00-00:02: camera: close-up, locked off, eye-level on Shanks\' face. The subject moves from an upright frontal stance facing forward to a head beginning to dip, his gaze sliding from somewhere off-frame ahead down toward his own left shoulder; his eyes stay open and unblinking, brows flat. Behind him the lead-grey storm clouds churn and whitecaps break across the tilted wooden boat. No dialogue.\\n00:02-00:04: camera: close-up, locked off, same eye-level framing, no additional movement. The subject moves from the slight chin tuck to a deeper bow of the head toward the front of his left shoulder, his gaze settling fully on the empty left sleeve; his lips press from relaxed into a thin straight line, jaw tightening slightly. The empty sleeve is pushed against his side by the wind. No dialogue.\\n00:04-00:05: camera: close-up, locked off. The subject settles at the low-headed posture, gaze still on the empty sleeve; the sleeve lifts at one corner in the gust and falls back against his body, red hair tips flicking in the wind. The framing still reads his profile and the empty sleeve clearly. No dialogue.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nOnly wind: a low continuous gust buffeting the boat, the flap of the empty sleeve against fabric, distant water slapping the hull, no voices, no breathing emphasis.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nNone. Silence apart from the wind, letting the held expression carry the beat.\\n<<<EN>>>"},{"heading":"闪回·扣帽（44-51秒） · 近海·风暴海面·黄昏 · 中景，固定，从香克斯侧后带