inks from the narrowed form down to a seven-year-old child\'s size, the black fur withdrawing from his arm to the back of his hand until it is gone. Shanks (S1) says: <d>[Chinese] お前だったのか。</d>\\n00:04-00:06 camera: medium shot, locked off, same framing. Shanks\' hand comes down from above Luffy\'s head and sets the straw hat onto his crown, the brim pressing his fringe; Luffy stays on the planks and tilts his face up, eyes wide, mouth slightly open. The closing frame still shows both faces and the hand placing the hat. No dialogue in this segment.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nRolling waves and sea wind recede into the distance across the shot, leaving a low hollow wash under the boat; a soft cloth-and-straw settle as the hat is placed at 00:04-00:06.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nA single sustained low string note fading out, no percussion, leaving near-silence under the hat placement.\\n<<<EN>>>"},{"heading":"反应·路飞睁眼（51-53秒） · 近海·风暴海面·黄昏 · 近景，固定，路飞正脸，2 秒","speaker":"路飞","dialogue":"","action":"路飞睁开眼，只觉得冷，看看自己的手，什么都没想起来。","camera":"近景，固定，路飞正脸，2 秒","scene":"近海·风暴海面·黄昏","time_of_day":"","id":"beat-f587b50efebe","image_url":"","video_url":"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/video/20261112/214415_84d6fb53542a78aa.mp4","duration":2,"prompt":"subject_definitions:\\n<Picture 1> Luffy character sheet: identity and appearance continuity (straw hat, red vest, scar under eye, black hair).\\n<Picture 2> Near-sea storm surface at dusk scene card: environment space (lead-grey clouds, churning white waves, tilted wooden boat, floating barrels, distant Windmill Village hill silhouette, salty sea mist).\\n\\nsummary:\\nA 2D cel-shaded anime close-up of Luffy on a stormy sea at dusk, opening his eyes and looking at his own hand with no memory of anything.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\nKeep <Picture 1> Luffy\'s face, hairstyle, straw hat, red vest and eye scar consistent; keep <Picture 2> the storm-sea dusk environment with tilted boat, white waves and distant hill silhouette. Do not carry the character sheet\'s white background, grid panels or repeated figures into the shot.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\n[Shot 1] 00:00-00:02 camera: close-up, locked off. Luffy moves from eyes closed and head lowered to eyelids lifting open, gaze rising from below to straight ahead; brows slightly knit, mouth flat. Salty sea mist drifts across the frame.\\n00:02-00:04 camera: close-up, locked off. The same action continues: Luffy\'s head turns from facing forward down toward his own hand, right hand rising from the boat plank to eye level; eyes focus on the palm, expression blank and puzzled.\\n00:04-00:05 camera: close-up, locked off. The action settles: Luffy stops with his hand raised before his face, brows slightly furrowed, lips flat, hair blown by the sea wind; the tilted boat plank and churning white waves remain visible around him.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nA single sharp sniff, wind gusts over the stormy sea, waves slapping the tilted wooden boat, distant low thunder rumble.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nLow sustained string drone with a faint cold pulse, no melody, fading under the wind.\\n<<<EN>>>"},{"heading":"船尾·缝（53-58秒） · 红色海贼船·船尾·清晨 · 中近景，固定，从背影带双手与草帽，5 秒","speaker":"香克斯","dialogue":"","action":"香克斯坐在船尾，把一缕黑发一样的细线缠进草帽内侧的帽檐，用针脚一针一针压住。","camera":"中近景，固定，从背影带双手与草帽，5 秒","scene":"红色海贼船·船尾·清晨","time_of_day":"","id":"beat-acb3867c8420","image_url":"","video_url":"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/video/20261112/214417_b7e548a7cff3d0f3.mp4","duration":5,"prompt":"subject_definitions:\\n<Picture 1> is the character sheet for Shanks, locking only his face, red hair and clothing for continuity; the sheet\'s panels, white background and repeated figures must never enter the shot. <Picture 2> is the scene card for the red pirate ship\'s stern at dawn, providing the wooden railing, sea surface and cold morning light as environment only, with no fixed blocking.\\n\\nsummary:\\nA single fixed medium close-up from behind Shanks at the stern of the red pirate ship at dawn, his hands and straw hat visible as he stitches a thin thread into the inner brim of the hat, one needle pass at a time.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\n<Picture 1> keeps Shanks\' red hair silhouette, facial features and clothing identical across all five seconds. <Picture 2> keeps the stern railing, deck planks and dawn sea light consistent as background. The straw hat and the thin thread remain the same object throughout, and the needle stays in his right hand from first stitch to last.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\n[Shot 1] 00:00-00:02: camera: medium close-up, locked off. The subject moves from a seated posture before the stern railing, right hand lifting the needle from beneath the inner brim to the brim\'s edge while the left hand presses a thin thread against the woven gap, ending with the needle tip touching the first stitch point. His gaze stays down on the hat, brows relaxed, mouth calm. 00:02-00:04: camera: medium close-up, locked off. The subject moves from the first stitch point forward through the second and third stitches, the thread pressed segment by segment into the weave, the left thumb sliding back with each pass, the motion larger than the previous beat. 00:04-00:05: camera: medium close-up, locked off. The subject settles with his head bowed over the brim, the needle held above the final stitch, red hair and hat edge catching hard morning highlights, his profile and both hands still clearly readable.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nA faint sea breeze over the stern, the soft creak of the wooden railing, and the fine dry rasp of the needle passing through the straw weave, close and intimate.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nA single low sustained string note with a soft plucked counterpoint, quiet and unhurried, fading under the needle sounds.\\n<<<EN>>>"},{"heading":"静·最后一针（58-60秒） · 红色海贼船·船尾·清晨 · 特写，固定，手与帽檐，2 秒","speaker":"香克斯","dialogue":"","action":"最后一针压住，手停在那儿不动，海面很静。","camera":"特写，固定，手与帽檐，2 秒","scene":"红色海贼船·船尾·清晨","time_of_day":"","id":"beat-0b3bdf167f8a","image_url":"","video_url":"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/video/20261112/214418_8b8eca30f93291a8.mp4","duration":2,"prompt":"subject_definitions:\\n<Picture 1> is the character sheet for Shanks, providing identity and appearance continuity: face, hairstyle, and clothing only, not pose. <Picture 2> is the scene card for the red pirate ship stern at dawn, providing the environment and spatial layout without locking character blocking.\\n\\nsummary:\\nA single fixed close-up on Shanks\'s hands and the straw hat brim at the stern of the red pirate ship at dawn, as the final stitch is pressed down and the hand comes to rest, the sea perfectly still.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\nRetain Shanks\'s straw hat, sleeve cuffs, and hand from <Picture 1>; retain the stern wooden railing, dawn side light, and calm sea horizon from <Picture 2>. The hat stays in its mended state throughout; no new damage appears.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\n[Shot 1] 00:00-00:02: camera: close-up, locked off. The subject moves from above the hat brim down onto the fabric edge, fingers pinching the needle as the final stitch is pressed into the straw weave, ending with the needle tip resting on the cloth. Dawn side light from the left, calm sea behind the stern railing.\\n00:02-00:04: camera: close-up, locked off. The subject moves from the pressed needle to a relaxed rest, fingers easing from firm pressure to a light touch on the brim, the needle no longer moving, ending with the hand still on the hat edge.\\n00:04-00:05: camera: close-up, locked off. The subject holds completely still, hand resting on the brim, knuckles and thread leaving a faint residual tension, the sea flat and motionless behind; the final frame still clearly reads as Shanks\'s hand and straw hat.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nComplete silence. No dialogue, no footsteps, no cloth rustle, no ambient sea sound; the shot is fully muted.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nNone. No music, no score, no tonal bed; total silence throughout the shot.\\n<<<EN>>>"},{"heading":"低吼（61-68秒） · 艾尔巴夫·雪原·闪前 · 大全景，固定，与开场同机位，6 秒","speaker":"黑猿","dialogue":"画外音：「この十秒を、誰も覚えていない。」","action":"黑猿在雪原上仰起头，张开嘴发出一声长吼，喉咙深处的气浪把身前的雪掀起来。","camera":"大全景，固定，与开场同机位，6 秒","scene":"艾尔巴夫·雪原·闪前","time_of_day":"","id":"beat-ad4843599be8","image_url":"","video_url":"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/video/20261112/214419_5ca547bd8bd03678.mp4","duration":6,"prompt":"subject_definitions:\\n<Picture 1> is the black ape character sheet, defining identity and silhouette continuity: face, hair and body covering only, not pose; never bring the sheet\'s panels, white background or repeated figures into the shot. <Picture 2> is the Elbaf snowfield flashback scene card, defining environment and spatial layout only, not blocking.\\n\\nsummary:\\nA single locked-off extreme wide shot on the Elbaf snowfield under a grey-white sky: the black ape lifts its head from a low crouch to a full skyward roar, and the pressure wave from deep in its throat throws the snow in front of it into the air.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\n<Picture 1> keeps the black ape\'s face, hair and body covering consistent across the whole shot; the pose changes from crouch to skyward roar but the design does not drift. <Picture 2> keeps the grey-white sky, black giant-tree silhouettes, falling snow, the non-human footprint and the cracked straw-hat edge in the foreground, with the same camera position as the opening shot. No keyframe image is generated for this shot; only the character sheet and the scene card are referenced.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\n[Shot 1]\\n00:00–00:02: camera: extreme wide shot, locked off, same position as the opening shot. The black ape moves from a low crouch in the snow to a straightened neck with the jaw slightly open, head rising from a lowered position; brows pressed down, eyes half-lidded, gaze lifting toward the sky. Snow falls left to right across the frame.\\n00:02–00:04: camera: extreme wide shot, locked off. The same motion continues: the black ape\'s head moves from the straightened neck to a full skyward angle, mouth open to its widest, a pressure wave bursting from deep in the throat and throwing the snow in front of it from the ground up into the air; brows pressed down, eyes half-lidded, jaw fully open, not smiling.\\n00:04–00:06: camera: extreme wide shot, locked off. The motion settles: the black ape stops in the skyward roaring pose, snow mist spreading in front of it, strands of hair and snow on its shoulders lifted by the pressure wave; the face and open mouth remain clearly readable. An off-screen inner voice (not produced by the on-screen mouth) says in an off-screen voiceover: <d>[Chinese] この十秒を、誰も覚えていない。</d> while all visible characters\' lips remain completely closed.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nA long low roar rolling across the snowfield, wind and driving snow throughout, and a very distant echo returning after the roar.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nNo music; only a faint low sustained drone under the roar, fading out at the end of the shot.\\n<<<EN>>>"}]}],"assets":[{"id":"ast-7fce496384c5","kind":"character","name":"玛琪诺","role":"酒馆老板娘","description":"二十出头的短发女性，白色衬衫配橙色背心裙，头上系头巾，手脚麻利，说话轻。她是这个下午唯一的目击者，全程只用眼神反应，不评价任何一方。","visual_prompt":"二十出头的短发女性，白色衬衫外穿橙色背心裙，腰间系围裙，头上系头巾束发，手里托一块木托盘，温和利落的表情；细眉圆眼，线条柔和，暖色调平涂。日本经典少年海盗漫画/动画原作设定稿画风（非官方同人二创），2D 赛璐璐平涂，中粗黑描线收边，硬边两层阴影，高饱和大色块，干净线稿，夸张透视；严禁写实照片质感、3D CGI、皮肤毛孔、胶片颗粒、渐变柔光、文字与水印","image_url":"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/image/20261111/180537_ed6efd6a0cc0f004.png"},{"id":"ast-5128a6c057a0","kind":"prop","name":"恶魔果实","role":"关键剧情道具","description":"类型: 关键剧情道具，关联角色/场景: 路飞","visual_prompt":"一颗紫灰色的恶魔果实，表面布满螺旋状卷纹，果蒂呈螺旋形，放在木桶板上；道具设定图，干净纯色背景。日本经典少年海盗漫画/动画原作设定稿画风（非官方同人二创），2D 赛璐璐平涂，中粗黑描线收边，硬边两层阴影，高饱和大色块，干净线稿，夸张透视；严禁写实照片质感、3D CGI、皮肤毛孔、胶片颗粒、渐变柔光、文字与水印","image_url":"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/image/20261111/180900_57e762927c3941ae.png"},{"id":"ast-dfcb39aa29bd","kind":"prop","name":"小刀","role":"人物固定道具